---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy – Modulum Studio</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Privacy Policy for Delyo app by Modulum Studio"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-950 text-white font-sans min-h-screen px-4 py-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Effective Date: January 8, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <!-- Introduction -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">Introduction</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Modulum Studio ("we," "our," or "us") operates the Delyo mobile
              application ("the App"). This Privacy Policy explains how we
              collect, use, and protect your information when you use our App.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              By using Delyo, you agree to the collection and use of information
              in accordance with this policy.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Information Collection -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Information Collection and Use
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Delyo is designed with privacy in mind. We do not collect, store,
              or process any personal information from users of our application.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              The App may collect minimal technical information necessary for
              basic functionality, such as:
            </p>
            <ul class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>
                Device type and operating system version (for compatibility
                purposes)
              </li>
              <li>App usage statistics (anonymous and aggregated)</li>
              <li>Crash reports (to improve app stability)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              This technical information cannot be used to identify individual
              users and is used solely for improving the App's performance and
              user experience.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Data Sharing -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">Data Sharing</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer any user information
              to third parties. Since we do not collect personal data, there is
              no personal information to share.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Any anonymous technical data collected may be shared with service
              providers solely for the purpose of app analytics and crash
              reporting to improve our services.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Data Security -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Data Security
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We implement appropriate security measures to protect against
              unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction of any
              information we may collect. However, since we do not collect
              personal information, the security risk is minimal.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Advertising and Tracking -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Advertising and Tracking
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Delyo does not display advertisements and does not use tracking
              technologies such as cookies or similar technologies to track
              users across other applications or websites.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Children's Privacy -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Children's Privacy
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Our App is suitable for all ages. Since we do not collect personal
              information from any users, including children under 13, we are in
              compliance with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act
              (COPPA).
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Changes to Policy -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Changes to This Privacy Policy
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify
              you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page
              and updating the "Effective Date" at the top of this policy.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any
              changes. Changes to this Privacy Policy are effective when they
              are posted on this page.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- Contact Information -->
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">
              Contact Information
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy,
              please contact us at:
            </p>
            <div
              class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 mt-4"
            >
              <p class="text-white font-medium">Modulum Studio</p>
              <p class="text-gray-300">Email: support@modulumstudio.com</p>
              <p class="text-gray-300">Website: https://modulumstudio.com</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="text-center mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-block border border-white text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-white hover:text-slate-950 transition duration-300"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
